  (text "R63 22R: source termination on SDMMC_CK, at the MCU (PC12),\nso clock reflections are absorbed instead of adding clock edges.\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §8."
    (at 95.25 189.23 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5b5b41e4-3d76-42f9-a3b0-96f85a9f7408")
  )
  (text "SD CARD\nCard detect on PG7 (SD_DETECT). SH on GND assumes detect returns through the shell;\ncheck a sample (m13). DAT/CMD pull-ups in the SD range, none on CLK.\nSDMMC1 starts at 8MHz for bring-up, 24MHz after checking TP11.\nCard power is not switchable; firmware recovers a hung card (M18).\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §8."
    (at 192.278 151.892 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "23847d3c-b34d-4b6d-ba5f-ea9778e3dd2d")
  )
