		(property "Description" "22R series termination on SDMMC_CK (PC12). CLK is the most edge-sensitive SD line: ringing crossing the threshold twice clocks in a bad bit. Brings the fast H7 driver up to ~50R and reduces EMI toward the card. Place at the MCU, not at J4."
